---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { SITE } from '../data/site';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms of Use | Antares Systems"
  description="The terms for using the Antares Systems website, including how our finance introductions and IT asset buyback service work."
  crumb="Terms of use"
>
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="wrap">
      <span class="eyebrow">Legal</span>
      <h1>Terms of use</h1>
      <p class="lead">Last updated {SITE.updated}.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="prose">
        <h2>About these terms</h2>
        <p>This website is operated by {SITE.legalName}, registered in England and Wales, company no. {SITE.companyNo}, registered office {SITE.address.join(', ')}. By using the site you accept these terms.</p>

        <h2>Information only</h2>
        <p>The site gives general information about our services. It is not advice, a recommendation or an offer of finance. All finance is subject to status and lender criteria, and nothing on this site guarantees that funding will be available.</p>

        <h2>Finance introductions</h2>
        <p>We introduce business customers to our regulated partner. We do not give advice or arrange finance. We will tell you how we are paid before you proceed.</p>

        <h2>IT asset buyback</h2>
        <p>We buy equipment on the basis of a written offer. An offer is not binding until you accept it and we have inspected the equipment. We will confirm the terms of each purchase in writing.</p>

        <h2>Accuracy</h2>
        <p>We take care over the information on this site, but we cannot promise that it is complete or up to date. Please contact us before relying on it for a decision.</p>

        <h2>Links</h2>
        <p>Our site may link to other websites. We do not control them and are not responsible for their content.</p>

        <h2>Intellectual property</h2>
        <p>The content and design of this site belong to {SITE.legalName} or its licensors. You may view and print pages for your own business use. You may not copy or reuse them for other purposes without our written permission.</p>

        <h2>Our liability</h2>
        <p>Nothing in these terms limits liability for death or personal injury caused by negligence, for fraud, or for anything else that cannot be limited by law. Subject to that, we are not liable for loss arising from your use of, or reliance on, the information on this site.</p>

        <h2>Governing law</h2>
        <p>These terms are governed by the law of England and Wales, and the courts of England and Wales have exclusive jurisdiction.</p>

        <h2>Contact</h2>
        <p>Questions about these terms: <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a>.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
